on/problem "Which of the graphs below correspond to an invertible function?\n\n![](images/6f/6fbded3e0a3faefda0e1f2c8418f5e271fb116cde4082487096378f89511b695.png)" :question/worked-solution "A function is invertible if and only if it's a one-to-one function. To determine which of the functions are one-to-one, we use the horizontal line test.  \n\n![](images/50/5036479a948abee5644cd3b96632f6aaf8ee370f7473ba27e11d25bb84ddb781.png)\n\nFrom the above, we see that: \n\n- In graph IV, any horizontal line will intersect the curve at most once, no matter where we draw the line. Therefore, graph IV  shows a one-to-one function. This means that the function is invertible.\n\n- For graphs I, II, and III, some horizontal lines intersect the curve more than once. So, these are not one-to-one functions. As a result, they are not invertible.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"IV only\"."} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3bd13aa5-83a8-5b23-96cb-ea665039ea30" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048686 :topic/math-academy-id 756 :topic/title "Graphs of Inverse Functions"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050525 :topic/math-academy-id 1886 :topic/title "One-To-One Functions"}] :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124945 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "261d9ebc-3761-5522-83de-662661527279" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439633} {:answer/id #uuid "46f72ccb-a1c7-5b04-a483-87efd5df56b8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439634}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "46f72ccb-a1c7-5b04-a483-87efd5df56b8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439634} :answer-field/id #uuid "5954b313-8f70-5702-b0ec-cf29f59d7bab" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440174} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d6955807-8093-5092-aaeb-32c4770e28cf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439635} {:answer/id #uuid "85a4c0d6-52e1-5e04-9a0b-bf60137a8760" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439636}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "85a4c0d6-52e1-5e04-9a0b-bf60137a8760" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439636} :answer-field/id #uuid "62a2ef7b-04b3-50b0-922d-fb4a22968393" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440175} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2606f809-631e-58ab-9e06-c79adf9c34f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439637} {:answer/id #uuid "92cbd450-1c35-5681-b860-60a804a43c5d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439638}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2606f809-631e-58ab-9e06-c79adf9c34f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439637} :answer-field/id #uuid "143d15bb-5b77-574f-a7ea-6b3ef9cb6ad0" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440176} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19011229-88be-5ff2-bf24-f9dc27d5ee15" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439639} {:answer/id #uuid "a1c8975c-2d57-56c7-9c4e-278adc6b3fb2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439640}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "19011229-88be-5ff2-bf24-f9dc27d5ee15" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439639} :answer-field/id #uuid "d1047a38-2080-510f-bd70-25c0173d095c" :answer-field/key "IV" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440177}] :question/id #uuid "75c89dd8-c054-57a5-9bbd-fa9eff000193" :question/math-academy-id "q-36000" :question/problem "![](images/8e/8e62c3485aed6c52001cc7ad8eda5c1eb09cd4873d6b740eb7595413dafa15e0.png)\n\nWhich of the graphs above correspond to an invertible function?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\nGraph positions: **I.** upper left; **II.** upper right; **III.** lower left; **IV.** lower right." :question/worked-solution "Graphs I and II are strictly monotone and pass the horizontal line test. Graphs III and IV each meet some horizontal line twice. There are four graphs, so all four labels are represented."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186125018 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "14a81cac-c158-5783-a483-6ff152ce8402" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439651} {:answer/id #uuid "42daca65-452a-55e0-9f61-39d7c2db68d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439652}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "42daca65-452a-55e0-9f61-39d7c2db68d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439652} :answer-field/id #uuid "cbaa5052-a72b-5b98-b51e-90609adfddc0" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440183} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e20e9770-acba-561c-b3c6-986ee3d60f50" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439653} {:answer/id #uuid "1c7138f1-0c5f-5149-a2d1-5a0a38eee3f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439654}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e20e9770-acba-561c-b3c6-986ee3d60f50" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439653} :answer-field/id #uuid "9689bba2-45c9-5064-985a-362a44ce82c7" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.ty