downward parabola. Thus II, III, and IV fail the horizontal line test; only I is invertible."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244143 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8a0350be-e06b-5da0-8286-d79d466cdbcd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437518} {:answer/id #uuid "f9aa62de-aa91-56bb-92b5-f32e48bd2a7b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437519}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8a0350be-e06b-5da0-8286-d79d466cdbcd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437518} :answer-field/id #uuid "e81cbb98-fd55-5674-8ffd-b8f5364c7566" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438788} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "616cf911-5cca-58c7-aad0-375b7975a364" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437520} {:answer/id #uuid "fa46cb13-84d3-589c-bce7-1426b00cb3cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437521}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "616cf911-5cca-58c7-aad0-375b7975a364" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437520} :answer-field/id #uuid "332f37fd-7255-5cb7-a8df-a6fd84707ad4" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438789} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "27988913-cc9c-5851-8088-a4fc4b07025c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437522} {:answer/id #uuid "6ad7502a-76db-51b2-ab1c-810e56d61640" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437523}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6ad7502a-76db-51b2-ab1c-810e56d61640" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437523} :answer-field/id #uuid "872fa28f-f3f6-529b-b025-3590a2dbec87" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438790} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5475e656-b1d4-5bfd-b6f4-46f7fafdc2d9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437524} {:answer/id #uuid "106d9768-5715-5dac-af04-f0b6918d6050" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437525}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5475e656-b1d4-5bfd-b6f4-46f7fafdc2d9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437524} :answer-field/id #uuid "8ae75796-57c8-5a22-9fb5-6a059099c71c" :answer-field/key "IV" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438791}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "dda73782-2027-59b5-9ca3-37b046a17959" :question/math-academy-id "q-108581" :question/problem "![](images/89/89b0be0ca7ae1a6e76d32bfc669d6f554deaaad2055b2875e3f6a49821043205.png)\n\nWhich of the graphs above correspond to an invertible function?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A function is invertible if and only if it's a one-to-one function. To determine which of the functions are one-to-one, we use the horizontal line test.\n\n![](images/cf/cfb095836b7498c91a5cbd9d2cb694715a0d89a12a5e6ea5ff417342c4bde798.png)\n\nFrom the above, we see that:\n\n- For graph III, any horizontal line will intersect the curve at most once, no matter where we draw the line. Therefore, graph III shows a one-to-one function. As a result, this function is invertible.\n\n- For graphs I, II, and IV, some horizontal lines intersect the curve more than once. These are not one-to-one functions. As a result, they are not invertible."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244144 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answe