d #edb/ref 17592186513070} :answer-field/id #uuid "1870fe7b-08ff-5347-9700-09628baa1879" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513037} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4440be4a-07b9-5f40-968a-97e65b93f53f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513050} {:answer/id #uuid "58295671-cc19-5462-8752-c4a8232bd2ba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513057}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "58295671-cc19-5462-8752-c4a8232bd2ba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513057} :answer-field/id #uuid "1ada8a85-67ee-5358-8a8b-b4f96023f943" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513039} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "50309cc7-1e3f-55f4-8aad-504f986d6d49" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513055} {:answer/id #uuid "b43e149a-7cbd-5c85-b9bf-7e1c4342f22c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513072}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b43e149a-7cbd-5c85-b9bf-7e1c4342f22c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513072} :answer-field/id #uuid "3c117d8b-ee39-5202-8ed9-a624653fcc83" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513048}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "2bc33971-dd15-55a7-b231-7bebd785a762" :question/problem "![](images/e6/e6fe5387a8fcd1ac6dc679ebff16ed15f2ecdf6e84b035e209aa869970357dfd.png)\n\nOn which of the following intervals is the function $f(x)$ (shown above) invertible?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\nI. $x\\in (-2,-1]\\cup (2,4]$\n\nII. $x\\in [0,2]$\n\nIII. $x\\in [-2,2]$" :question/worked-solution "A function is invertible on a particular interval if and only if it's a one-to-one function on that interval. To determine the intervals on which the function is invertible, we use the horizontal line test.\n\n- On interval I, $x\\in (-2,-1]\\cup (2,4]$, the function is invertible. Indeed, any horizontal line will intersect the restricted graph at most once, no matter where we draw the line.\n\n- On interval II, $x\\in [0,2]$, the function is invertible. Indeed, any horizontal line will intersect the restricted graph at most once, no matter where we draw the line.\n\n- On interval III, $x\\in [-2,2]$, the function is **not** invertible. Some horizontal lines will intersect the restricted graph more than once.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186513046 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "da8bf321-361b-55da-a675-b901506bcb36" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513083} {:answer/id #uuid "de02c92b-35bb-5677-9dbc-e91148ece4fe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513085}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "da8bf321-361b-55da-a675-b901506bcb36" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513083} :answer-field/id #uuid "0cf2f0eb-c62b-5ce1-ab6a-bf06fb4db508" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513033} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8bb4751c-d78d-57d0-8581-7985554118b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513060} {:answer/id #uuid "9e0f31fe-2d74-589a-aa1b-3926d88b3fa7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186513063}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9e0f31fe-2d74-589a-aa1b-3926d88b3fa7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "tru